These three files are copies, not sources. They belong to the mlops platform:

    src/geo_mlops/resources/training_runtime/

They are vendored here so verify_mlops.sh can run on a machine that has no
mlops checkout -- the GPU nodes worth testing on are exactly the ones that do
not carry the platform's source. verify_mlops.sh prefers a real checkout
whenever it finds one and warns when this copy has drifted from it.

Do not edit them here. Edit them in mlops and refresh:

    ./scripts/verify_mlops.sh --mlops /path/to/mlops --update-bundle

